1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,875
Now take a beam bridge.

2
00:00:03,025 --> 00:00:07,825
Its deck rests on long beams that span
from one support to the next.

3
00:00:07,975 --> 00:00:11,825
Each beam carries the
load by resisting bending.

4
00:00:11,975 --> 00:00:16,180
A cap beam spreads the load onto the
posts, and the posts carry it down

5
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,750
in compression.
